+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is required everywhere, including development builds: the project previously carried an exception allowing certificate verification to be bypassed in development builds, but that exception has been withdrawn with no replacement, so there is no dev-build special case and certificates must be verified in all builds.
